    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n90370" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσχέω</span></b> , fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-χεῶ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Le.</u>
					1.5
				</span></i>
			:—<i>pour to</i> or <i>on</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
			</span></i> l.c., al., <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Sacr.</u>
				9
			</span></i> (s. v.l.):—
				Med.
			, <i>pour</i> water <i>on oneself</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Steril.</u>
				230
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Diocl. Fr.
				139
			</span></i>; <i>have poured on one</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ θερμόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Somn.Vig.</u>
					457b14
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pr.</u>
				875a9
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.242
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσεχύθη πρὸ τῶν οὔρων αἷμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
					<u>SD</u>
					2.3
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph. in 
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ τοῦ Χρυσίππου προσχυθεὶς
				ἀδολεσχίας</span>
			<i>deluged</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				5.318
			</span></i>.</div>
